{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日風強いよ～風( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーやめてくれ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花粉症の人はきっとこの\n風は辛いだろう可哀想に(´;ω;`)泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あたしはね花粉症なったこと\nないんだけどね外に出る時は\n花粉症予防でマスクしてるの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か花粉って体にあんま\nとりいれたくない！うん\n予防ってやつかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よし！花粉症なんて一生\nなんないぜ♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言いながらぶろぐ\n書いてたら目が涙目に\nなってきた( •ㅈ• )あれ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"痒くは....ないけど？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれこれはきっと気のせいだ！\nうん、気のせい気のせい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花粉症になんてなるわけ..ないよね♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か最近春になってきたから\n洋服が明るい色ばっかりに\nなってきたな♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春が1番好きなんだよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、バックだけ黒だw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリームベージュとか白いバック\n欲しいな♡探してみよっと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2013/03/18/7229186/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん♡好きよ♡\nそれでは打ち合わせいってきます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}